      "translation": "`<code><a href=\"../TransportHandler.html#checkSessionType(org.springframework.web.socket.sockjs.transport.SockJsSession)\">checkSessionType</a></code>` 接口 `<code><a href=\"../TransportHandler.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.web.socket.sockjs.transport\">TransportHandler</a></code>` 中",
