      "source": "<code><a href=\"../SockJsSessionFactory.html#createSession(java.lang.String,org.springframework.web.socket.WebSocketHandler,java.util.Map)\">createSession</a></code> in interface <code><a href=\"../SockJsSessionFactory.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.web.socket.sockjs.transport\">SockJsSessionFactory</a></code>",
