    {
      "source": "<code><a href=\"../../../server/HandshakeHandler.html#doHandshake(org.springframework.http.server.ServerHttpRequest,org.springframework.http.server.ServerHttpResponse,org.springframework.web.socket.WebSocketHandler,java.util.Map)\">doHandshake</a></code> in interface <code><a href=\"../../../server/HandshakeHandler.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.web.socket.server\">HandshakeHandler</a></code>",
      "translation": "`<code><a href=\"../../../server/HandshakeHandler.html#doHandshake(org.springframework.http.server.ServerHttpRequest,org.springframework.http.server.ServerHttpResponse,org.springframework.web.socket.WebSocketHandler,java.util.Map)\">doHandshake</a></code>` 接口 `<code><a href=\"../../../server/HandshakeHandler.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.web.socket.server\">HandshakeHandler</a></code>` 中",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>handler</code> - the handler to process WebSocket messages; see\n<a href=\"../../../handler/PerConnectionWebSocketHandler.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.web.socket.handler\"><code>PerConnectionWebSocketHandler</code></a> for providing a handler with\nper-connection lifecycle.",
      "translation": "<code>handler</code> - 用于处理 WebSocket 消息的处理器；有关提供具有每连接生命周期的处理器，请参阅<a href=\"../../../handler/PerConnectionWebSocketHandler.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.web.socket.handler\"><code>PerConnectionWebSocketHandler</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code><a href=\"../../../server/HandshakeFailureException.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.web.socket.server\">HandshakeFailureException</a></code> - thrown when handshake processing failed to\ncomplete due to an internal, unrecoverable error, i.e. a server error as\nopposed to a failure to successfully negotiate the handshake.",
      "translation": "<code><a href=\"../../../server/HandshakeFailureException.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.web.socket.server\">HandshakeFailureException</a></code> - 当握手处理因内部不可恢复的错误而未能完成时抛出，即服务器错误，而非握手协商失败。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>id</code> - the ID of the session",
      "translation": "<code>id</code> - 会话的 ID",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>attrs</code> - handshake request specific attributes",
      "translation": "<code>attrs</code> - 握手请求特定属性",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>request</code> - the current request",
      "translation": "<code>request</code> - 当前请求",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>response</code> - the current response",
      "translation": "<code>response</code> - 当前响应",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Invoked after population of normal bean properties but before an init\ncallback like InitializingBean's <code>afterPropertiesSet</code> or a\ncustom init-method. Invoked after ApplicationContextAware's\n<code>setApplicationContext</code>.",
      "translation": "在普通 Bean 属性填充之后、但在初始化回调（如 `InitializingBean` 的 `<code>afterPropertiesSet</code>` 或自定义的 init-method）之前调用。在 `ApplicationContextAware` 的 `<code>setApplicationContext</code>` 之后调用。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "In the case of a container, this will return <code>true</code> only if <i>all</i>\ncomponents that apply are currently running.",
      "translation": "对于容器而言，仅当所有适用的组件当前都在运行时，此方法才返回 `<code>true</code>`。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Note that this stop notification is not guaranteed to come before destruction:\nOn regular shutdown, <code>Lifecycle</code> beans will first receive a stop notification\nbefore the general destruction callbacks are being propagated; however, on hot\nrefresh during a context's lifetime or on aborted refresh attempts, a given bean's\ndestroy method will be called without any consideration of stop signals upfront.",
      "translation": "请注意，此停止通知并不保证在销毁之前发出：\n在常规关闭过程中，<code>Lifecycle</code> 圈会先接收停止通知，然后再传播通用的销毁回调；然而，在上下文生命周期期间的热刷新或中止的刷新尝试中，给定 bean 的销毁方法将在不考虑任何预先停止信号的情况下被调用。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Should not throw an exception if the component is already running.",
      "translation": "如果组件已经在运行，则不应抛出异常。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "In the case of a container, this will propagate a hard start signal to all\ncomponents that apply, even to non-auto-startup components.",
      "translation": "对于容器而言，这将向所有适用的组件传播硬启动信号，即使包括非自动启动的组件。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Should not throw an exception if the component is not running (not started yet).",
      "translation": "如果组件尚未运行（尚未启动），则不应抛出异常。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "In the case of a container, this will propagate the stop signal to all components\nthat apply.",
      "translation": "对于容器，这将向所有适用的组件传播停止信号。",
      "count": 1
    },
