    {
      "source": "<code>true</code> if the session matches (and would therefore get\naccepted by <a href=\"../TransportHandler.html#handleRequest(org.springframework.http.server.ServerHttpRequest,org.springframework.http.server.ServerHttpResponse,org.springframework.web.socket.WebSocketHandler,org.springframework.web.socket.sockjs.transport.SockJsSession)\"><code>TransportHandler.handleRequest(ServerHttpRequest, ServerHttpResponse, WebSocketHandler, SockJsSession)</code></a>), or <code>false</code> otherwise",
      "translation": "<code>true</code> 如果会话匹配（因此会被<a href=\"../TransportHandler.html#handleRequest(org.springframework.http.server.ServerHttpRequest,org.springframework.http.server.ServerHttpResponse,org.springframework.web.socket.WebSocketHandler,org.springframework.web.socket.sockjs.transport.SockJsSession)\"><code>TransportHandler.handleRequest(ServerHttpRequest, ServerHttpResponse, WebSocketHandler, SockJsSession)</code></a>接受），否则为<code>false</code>",
      "count": 1
    },
