    {
      "source": "<code><a href=\"../../SockJsException.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.web.socket.sockjs\">SockJsException</a></code> - raised when request processing fails as\nexplained in <a href=\"../../SockJsService.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.web.socket.sockjs\"><code>SockJsService</code></a>",
      "translation": "<code><a href=\"../../SockJsException.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.web.socket.sockjs\">SockJsException</a></code> - 在请求处理失败时抛出，具体原因见 <a href=\"../../SockJsService.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.web.socket.sockjs\"><code>SockJsService</code></a>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>handler</code> - the underlying <a href=\"../../../WebSocketHandler.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.web.socket\"><code>WebSocketHandler</code></a>",
